{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果在M5 Ultra版Mac Studio發佈數月之後，終於開始接受此前「跳票」的512GB內存配置訂單，而這一配置的價格相當驚人。蘋果於2026年8月推出搭載M5 Ultra與M5 Max晶片的Mac Studio，但當時僅在一個幾乎不起眼的腳註中提到，還有一個配置將在稍後推出——儘管蘋果當時聲稱Mac Studio可配置至512GB內存，實際上用户根本無法下單，直到現在才真正放開。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584220.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T18:41:48.749626+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T18:26:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T18:38:44.459597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T18:38:44.459597+00:00","content_hash":"ec07c33e3cb7f5260745bc4c2d20e1743bc0f1f11d49298c940b8028433c8128","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}